<title>HUNGARY: KEKKUTI H1 AFTER-TAX PROFIT HUF 87.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>KEKKUTI H1 AFTER-TAX PROFIT HUF 87.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					Jan-June 1997</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  106.3</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		     94.1</p>
<p>    After-tax profit		   87.5</p>
<p>    Net sales			   766.7</p>
<p>	Domestic sales		  727.2</p>
<p>	Export sales		     39.5</p>
<p>    Other revenue			22.2</p>
<p>    Material expenditures	   467.8</p>
<p>    Personnel expenditures	   67.4</p>
<p>    Depreciation			 32.9</p>
<p>    Other costs			 116.3</p>
<p>    Other expenditures		 37.2</p>
<p>    Net financial income		6.9 loss</p>
<p>	Financial revenue		 0.3</p>
<p>	Financial expenditure	   7.2</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income	  5.3 loss</p>
<p>	Extraordinary revenue	   0.9</p>
<p>	Extraordinary expenditure     6.2</p>
<p>    Taxation				6.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Kekkuti Asvanyviz Rt is a mineral water bottler and distributor. The figures are unaudited and were calculated in accordance with Hungarian Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>The company did not provide comparative figures.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
